        <Param val="Reaction time task&#10;&#10;Keep your eyes on the cross in the centre of the screen.&#10;&#10;A white dot will appear on the LEFT or RIGHT.&#10;&#10;LEFT dot  -&gt;  LEFT index finger&#10;RIGHT dot  -&gt;  RIGHT index finger&#10;&#10;Respond as quickly and accurately as you can.&#10;&#10;First, look at the target dot so we can check the eye tracker.&#10;&#10;Press either button when ready." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text" />
        <Param val="pix" valType="str" updates="None" name="units" />
